            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloko kekena ni, “An doŋ alimo ryeko madit makato ryeko pa luker ducu ma gukwoŋo nyima ma gubedo ka loc i Jerucalem; dok kit ryeko ki ŋec ducu doŋ atyeko ŋiyo kwede.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aketo cwinya me ŋeyo ryeko, ki me ŋeyo apoya ki miŋo. Anoŋo ni magi ducu bene obedo calo ryemo kor yamo ma kodo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
